From 007b4aa323d0052350107da5f4a1fc04ad139de7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Data-crea <sattler.daniel@hotmail.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 16:25:52 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Open fix 31: present without VSync on request (platform.cpp)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

ORION2RE_NO_VSYNC=1 passes 0 to both SDL_SetRenderVSync calls
(platform.cpp:644, :1390); without the variable nothing changes.
ORION2RE_EXT-gated.

WHY. A session-launched engine hung in its first logo frames whenever
its window was not being drawn - the screen locked or blanked, or the
window covered by a full-screen game. Backtraces (OrionLayer work order
174 A) show the game thread in JIM::Draw_Logos_ waiting with no timeout
for a present (video::Submit_Palette_ / Publish_Off_Page_,
SDL_WaitCondition timeoutNS=-1) and the main thread inside that present,
SDL_RenderPresent with VSync on, in the NVIDIA GLX swap's
drmSyncobjTimelineWait. Disabling explicit sync, the Vulkan and the
software renderer each only moved the wait; not waiting for VSync
removed it: 0 hangs in 50 starts against 8 in 60. The same cause
throttled a running engine behind a full-screen game to about one frame
a second.

Applied by OrionLayer work order 175 on Data's authorisation;
doc/ext_present_no_vsync.patch in orionlayerv3 is the patch and its
evidence. A timeout on the game thread's wait would be the deeper fix;
not attempted.

Ported onto orion2re v2.0.0 in scratch (work order 242 e) from local f98b8547:
class (a) in behaviour: v2 has interface.vsync_enabled (config) feeding g_requested_vsync_enabled, applied at present time. Ported by hand as an env override inside v2's Publish_Present_Scaler_Config so OrionLayer's ORION2RE_NO_VSYNC keeps working; the local hunks at the two SDL_SetRenderVSync(…,1) calls do not exist in v2.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/game/platform.cpp | 14 +++++++++++++-
 1 file changed, 13 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/game/platform.cpp b/src/game/platform.cpp
index ac46b9c5..1ceac5e7 100755
--- a/src/game/platform.cpp
+++ b/src/game/platform.cpp
@@ -94,7 +94,19 @@ namespace platform {
 
         void Publish_Present_Scaler_Config() {
             SDL_SetAtomicInt(&g_requested_present_scaler, (int)platform::g_present_scaler);
-            SDL_SetAtomicInt(&g_requested_vsync_enabled, platform::g_vsync_enabled != 0 ? 1 : 0);
+            int vsync_enabled = platform::g_vsync_enabled != 0 ? 1 : 0;
+#ifdef ORION2RE_EXT
+            // ORION2RE_NO_VSYNC=1 (OrionLayer open fix 31): present without
+            // waiting for the display, whatever interface.vsync_enabled says.
+            // A VSync present to a window the compositor is not drawing never
+            // completes; unattended runs set this. v2's own switch is the
+            // config key interface.vsync_enabled = false.
+            const char* no_vsync = SDL_getenv("ORION2RE_NO_VSYNC");
+            if (no_vsync != nullptr && no_vsync[0] != '\0' && no_vsync[0] != '0') {
+                vsync_enabled = 0;
+            }
+#endif
+            SDL_SetAtomicInt(&g_requested_vsync_enabled, vsync_enabled);
             Request_Present_Refresh();
         }
 
